[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10981.83, "timestamp": "03:03:01", "text": "比如背景之类的提醒，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10985.11, "timestamp": "03:03:05", "text": "这还会带来另一个复杂情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10989.349, "timestamp": "03:03:09", "text": "那就像，你知道，一个观众"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10991.03, "timestamp": "03:03:11", "text": "他们要去看看购物中心，然后就进来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10993.11, "timestamp": "03:03:13", "text": "你的直播，他们可以看到资产，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10995.51, "timestamp": "03:03:15", "text": "他们会说，“呃，它没有……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10998.389, "timestamp": "03:03:18", "text": "挺合适的。那种感觉，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11001.67, "timestamp": "03:03:21", "text": "感觉有点不对劲。”于是，我看到了一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11003.99, "timestamp": "03:03:23", "text": "YouTuber们也遇到过这样的问题：他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11007.19, "timestamp": "03:03:27", "text": "就像那些铁涡旋钻机一样，模型，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11010.15, "timestamp": "03:03:30", "text": "但由于一切都像是预算有限。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11014.07, "timestamp": "03:03:34", "text": "友好的。嗯。在某种程度上，有些人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11017.269, "timestamp": "03:03:37", "text": "感觉好像……嗯，看起来有点不对劲，很奇怪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11020.469, "timestamp": "03:03:40", "text": "某物或某物或某物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11023.83, "timestamp": "03:03:43", "text": "是的。氛围方面，质量也很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11027.11, "timestamp": "03:03:47", "text": "氛围就是彩带那玩意儿，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11031.59, "timestamp": "03:03:51", "text": "呃，现在的观看质量，所以……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11034.79, "timestamp": "03:03:54", "text": "是的，我最终会面对"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11037.75, "timestamp": "03:03:57", "text": "这个问题确实存在，但没关系，每个人都是新手。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11039.83, "timestamp": "03:03:59", "text": "现在我在某个地方，所以我要去展示一下"}]